# Avengers Assemble!: its "Hero" is a word of its text (CR 612.1), which Artificial Evolution changes to Elf: the Avengers
# then boosts Elves you control, and draws for an Elf that entered or attacked, not for a Hero. Bot1's Llanowar Elves enters
# on turn 3 as a 3/3: Bot1 draws at that end step; on turn 5 it attacks (Bot2 goes to 17) and Bot1 draws at that end step.
# Bot1 holds 1 card after turn 1 (the Elves), plays the Forest drawn on turn 3 and casts the Elves, and so ends with the
# card of each of the two end steps and turn 5's draw: 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Avengers Assemble!
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Artificial Evolution
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Avengers Assemble!.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artificial Evolution.Cast(Avengers Assemble!)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Hero)
Bot1.Modes(Elf)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
[T7 Bot1.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
Bot2.Life = 17
